    "10030629": "Ugh, you're right. What a big trouble I can't run away from.",
    "10030630": "...Alright, let's see what she wants.",
    "10030701": "It's great to see that you're recovering well.",
    "10030702": "Would you like something to drink, Officer? Tales of Icelake is on special today — half price!",
