    "10030713": "{性别:|Come on!} Come here, boy!",
    "10030714": "What— I'm not a dog!",
    "10030715": "...Alright, I've verified the travel permit. Thank you for your cooperation. Now, let's talk about the attack.",
    "10030716":
        "I want to catch the culprit who attacked you and bring safety back to everyone as soon as possible. As the sole survivor of the incident, your testimony is vital for us to fully understand the case. That said, this tavern is hardly an appropriate place for an enquiry—",
