    "10030728": "*sighs* Fine. Let's do this.",
    "10030801": "I thought it would be somewhere like an office.",
    "10030802":
        "I come here to clear my head when I'm feeling overwhelmed. It's quiet, and there's rarely anyone around — perfect for discussing serious matters.",
    "10030803": 'So, the "Charon Hunt" is a series of murders that took place here in Icelake. I assume you\'ve already heard about it.',
    "10030804": "November 22, early morning: 5 dead, 1 injured. November 25, early morning: 13 dead.",
