    "10030806": "Yeah, we've heard about that. What do you need from {nickname}?",
    "10030807":
        "I need {nickname} to provide as many details about the case as possible. In a while, I'll take you all to the scene where {性别:he|she} was attacked five days ago. That street is currently sealed off by the Legion.",
