    "10030820":
        "Whoa, nothing like that! Don't worry, Officer, we're law-abiding folks. It's just that our captain got separated from {性别:his|her} family, and might need your help to look for them.",
    "10030821": "Got separated from your family?",
    "10030822":
        'I completely understand how you feel. I barely get to see my family all year round... Once the "Charon Hunt" case is resolved, I promise I\'ll do everything in my power to help you find your family!',
    "10030823": "(Uh... Why is she so fired up all of a sudden? I... I can't breathe...)",
    "10030824": "L—Let's just head to the crime scene first, Officer.",
    "10030901": "Captain, you're really something, daring to bargain with a legion officer.",
    "10030902": "Didn't you say she was easy to deal with?",
