    "10030906": "You flatter me. Staying sharp at all times is essential for carrying out duties more effectively.",
    "10030907": "(I was not flattering!)",
    "10031001": "This is it. {nickname}, does this street look familiar?",
    "10031004": "Do you recall the approximate time of the attack?",
    "10031005":
        "Not really. At the time, I was... not feeling great. I figured I wouldn't be able to sleep, so I decided to take a walk around the city.",
