    "10031008": "It's fine. It was me who insisted on having some time alone.",
    "10031009":
        "(Wait... I remember when I reached this street, the wind had just stopped, and the moon came out. Judging by the moon's position, it must've been... <H>between 4 and 5 a.m.</>)",
    "10031010": "(I should tell Rhythm about this.)",
    "10031101":
        "Between 4 and 5 a.m... Hmm, that matches perfectly with Camilla Scarlet's testimony. It seems your memory is sharp and hasn't been affected by your time spent unconscious.",
