        "The last thing I saw before passing out was a monstrous face. Though I'm not sure if it was a Filthoid or something else entirely.",
    "10031105": "Hmm... A monster. That fits with what we know so far. Is there anything else you can remember?",
    "10031106": "Wait, there's one more thing!",
    "10031107": "Please go ahead!",
    "10031108": "The singing voice...",
    "10031109": "I remember something following me on this street. Along with its footsteps, I heard... its singing.",
