        "Yes, that's it. Its voice was raspy, broken — almost like wind blowing through shattered pipes. But <H>that monster was unmistakably singing</>.",
    "10031111":
        "A singing voice? No one else has mentioned that — Great, this is a brand-new lead! I knew your suffering wouldn't be in vain.",
    "10031112": "Ahem, Officer, that might come across as a bit insensitive, don't you think?",
    "10031113":
        "...My apologies. I was just thinking that with this new clue, we might finally end this case and restore peace to everyone. I didn't mean to trivialise your pain and suffering. I'm truly sorry.",
