    "10044208#speaker": "Tipsy Worker",
    "10044209#speaker": "Tipsy Worker",
    "10044318#option": "Stiller's position.",
    "10044319#option": "Stiller's manner.",
    "10044320#option": "The culprit's method.",
    "10044602#option": "Gag him. I don't want to hear another word.",
    "10044606#option": "You owe that apology to Stéphane.",
    "10044607#option": "At least no one was hurt.",
    "10045005#speaker": "Princess Flodia",
    "10045006#speaker": "Princess Flodia",
    "10045007#speaker": "Princess Flodia",
    "10045008#speaker": "Princess Flodia",
    "10045009#speaker": "Princess Flodia",
    "10045011#speaker": "Princess Flodia",
    "10046111#option": "That's right. We came from first class. Go on, call him over. Let's see if he dares lay a finger on us.",
    "10046112#option": "Here's a better idea. You ever heard the saying? A favour at the right moment is worth more than a fancy gift.",
    "10046113#option": "Is that a threat? We're all just trying to get where we're going. No need to give each other trouble.",
    "10047209#option": "And I'm his cousin too.",
    "10047210#option": "You've heard her play. I trust you to make the sensible choice.",
    "10047211#option": "(They're sharp. One piece, and they've already sensed she's not a commoner.)",
