    "11101402#speaker": "\"'The Chariot' Victor\"",
    "11101405#option": "I see.",
    "11101406#option": "Pretty proud of yourself, aren't you...",
    "11101409#option": "It's all right.",
    "11101410#option": "You murdered my bunny.",
    "11101606#option": "Why is this amusement park in ruins?",
    "11101612#option": "Has anyone from the Legion come here recently?",
    "11101618#option": "What do these titles mean? Chariot, and the others.",
    "11101621#option": "Family...",
    "11101623#option": "Are you sure you're not supposed to be the Fool?",
    "11101625#option": "I want a cooler name.",
    "11101701#speaker": "\"'The Chariot' Victor\"",
    "11101703#speaker": "\"'The Chariot' Victor\"",
    "11101902#option": "I imagined it was a man with black-and-white hair. Someone I hate.",
    "11101903#option": "The Legion made me strong.",
    "11101904#option": "Once you know the trick, you can do it too.",
    "11102204#option": "That doesn't sound very fun. Let's skip it.",
    "11102205#option": "What kind of roller coaster is that?",
