    "11108302#speaker": "\"'The Chariot' Victor\"",
    "11108604#option": '(Say "Chomp!" confidently.)',
    "11108607#option": '(Say "Chomp!" half-heartedly.)',
    "11108610#option": "Falsi, you say it.",
    "11108805#option": "They're identical. Even the stains and little tears are in the same places.",
    "11108807#option": "What's wrong is that someone hid a pile of torn-up flags all the way back here like treasure.",
    "11108913#option": "All right. Let me think where to start.",
    "11108915#option": "Sorry, I've got other things to do.",
    "11108917#option": "(Tell them about your days at the Imperial Military College.)",
    "11108936#option": "(Tell them about your years serving in the Legion.)",
    "11109507#option": "(Reluctantly play along.)",
    "11109509#option": "(Mess with her.)",
    "11109511#option": "(Play along properly.)",
    "11109515#option": "Relax. It's just role-play.",
    "11109516#option": "I don't think Ada is really an Elysian Divine Herald. Calm down.",
    "11109517#option": "If she's an Elysian Divine Herald, I'm the Emperor of Hyperborea.",
    "11109518#option": "Don't forget to give me my cut of the spy-hunting reward.",
    "11109520#option": "(Attack.)",
    "11109524#option": "(Parry.)",
    "11109528#option": "(Use the Combat Skill.)",
    "11109533#option": "(Attack.)",
