    "12070081#speaker": "Forlorn Old Woman",
    "120701#desc":
        "A doll found in Rae's secret hideout. A portrait bearing a striking resemblance to Lieutenant Colonel Johnson has been pasted over its face.",
    "120701#name": "A portrait resembling Lieutenant Colonel Johnson has been pasted over the doll's face",
    "12070101#desc": "Go to The Asphodel to begin the quest.",
    "12070101#name": "Head to The Asphodel",
    "12070102#desc": "Go to The Asphodel to begin the quest.",
    "12070102#name": "Head to The Asphodel",
    "12070103#desc":
        "Camilla's advice to listen to your heart brought to mind a place you haven't visited in a long time. Perhaps it's time to face those memories. Return to your secret base.",
    "12070103#name": "Head to the secret base",
    "12070134#speaker": "Alert Guard",
    "12070135#speaker": "Alert Guard",
    "12070137#speaker": "Alert Guard",
